  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Mexicans are impoverished, primitive, and inferior, using a dehumanizing metaphor of a monkey to imply they are 'starving' and 'eating peanuts'. This stereotype is part of a broader pattern of anti-Latino/hispanic racism that includes claims of criminality, laziness, and being 'anchor babies' or job stealers. The image and text together invoke this harmful stereotype.",
